---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer — The Money Margin"
  description="Financial and Advertising Disclaimer for The Money Margin. Read about our editorial principles and financial disclosure."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 sm:py-12">
    <div class="mb-8 font-sans">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5C6B7A] mb-4">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#E67E22] transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-[#E67E22] font-bold">Disclaimer</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B3C] font-sans tracking-tight">
        Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-sans font-semibold text-[#5C6B7A] mt-2">
        Last Updated: November 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="font-serif text-[#1A2B3C] text-base sm:text-lg leading-[1.8] space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          1. General Financial & Informational Purpose
        </h2>
        <p>
          The content published on <strong>The Money Margin</strong> (<a href="https://moneymarginsecret.com" class="text-[#E67E22] hover:underline">moneymarginsecret.com</a>) is for general educational, personal documentary, and informational purposes only. The author, Daniel Reyes, is a tech product operations specialist sharing first-hand budgeting, debt repayment, and personal credit rebuilding experiences.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>The author is NOT a certified financial planner (CFP), registered investment advisor (RIA), certified public accountant (CPA), or attorney.</strong> Nothing on this website constitutes professional financial, investment, tax, legal, or credit counseling advice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          2. Personal Responsibility & Accuracy
        </h2>
        <p>
          Financial situations vary dramatically depending on location, tax jurisdiction, income, and debt profiles. While every effort is made to present honest figures, methodologies, and exact calculations, rates and bank policies change frequently. Readers must independently verify all interest rates (APR), terms, and fees directly with lenders or consult a licensed professional before making financial commitments.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          3. Advertising & Sponsorship Disclosure
        </h2>
        <p>
          This website may display digital advertisements through network partners, including Google AdSense. These advertisements are clearly separated from editorial content. The author does not accept paid endorsements that dictate personal opinions, nor do advertisers determine article subjects or scoring methods.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          4. Contact
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding this disclosure, please email <a href="mailto:wrwanshenchen@gmail.com" class="text-[#E67E22] font-semibold hover:underline font-mono">wrwanshenchen@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
